DingoDocs AWS Marketplace deploy
Copyright 2026 Yuma IT

This repository contains Terraform, Helm, CloudFormation, and IAM artifacts
for deploying the DingoDocs container product in a buyer AWS account.

These deployment artifacts and the DingoDocs source are Apache-2.0 licensed.
Access to the Marketplace application image requires a DingoDocs AWS
Marketplace subscription and is also subject to the listing terms. Use only the
image references shown to subscribed buyers by AWS Marketplace.
